# The LexLean revision this repository is checked with, and the only place it is
# written (AGENTS.md R1). .github/workflows/lexlean.yml builds `lexlean` at this
# commit and fails unless that binary computes the language-1.2 compiler-semantics
# ID that lexlean.lock records.
